{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALL MEAT LAB PARTICIPANTS UNLOCK EXCLUSIVE COSMETIC SET IN FINAL GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join MEAT LAB 7 \u2014 SWAPMEAT's <strong>final global playtest</strong> \u2014 from September 4 - 9 and earn this duckin' <i>sweet</i>\u00a0exclusive cosmetic set with which to adorn your  Meat Scientist at launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/b04d3facac02676ad90e64cdeefea505.avif?t=1756971820\" width=1280 height=467 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEAL LIMBS. SWAP POWERS. CLEAN UP CARL'S MESS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to SWAPMEAT \u2013 the fast-paced co-op roguelite shooter where every kill makes you stronger ... and stranger! Rip through alien worlds, harvest mutant body parts, and help Carl Rangus fix what\u2019s broken. Rip through alien worlds, harvest mutant body parts, and become the ultimate corporate problem-solver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/fb413a0b5089bbd3472badd1857813a0.poster.avif?t=1756971820\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/fb413a0b5089bbd3472badd1857813a0.webm?t=1756971820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/fb413a0b5089bbd3472badd1857813a0.mp4?t=1756971820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE CORPORATE SLAUGHTERHOUSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re the freshest SmartMeat\u2122 scientist at Rangus Meats, a galaxy-spanning megacorp whose innovation and disruption may or may not have triggered a galactic crisis that infested worlds with hungry mutants and murderous robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop onto hostile planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contain the spread (and collect samples)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap out your squishy parts in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive long enough to receive your employee evaluation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every alien you harvest gives you new body parts with unique powers \u2014 triple-jump legs, turret-dropping torsos, grenade-launching heads, and many more. Build yourself into the ultimate corporate solution, one ethically questionable upgrade at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/ecc020ae50e5e55814c27c5e8afac531.poster.avif?t=1756971820\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/ecc020ae50e5e55814c27c5e8afac531.webm?t=1756971820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/ecc020ae50e5e55814c27c5e8afac531.mp4?t=1756971820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap on the Fly</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip, swap, and mutate mid-combat. Build your masterpiece (or disaster) one part at a time, adapting to every new threat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Fluid Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, skill-based gunplay inspired by\u00a0<i>Risk of Rain 2</i>\u00a0and\u00a0<i>Helldivers 2</i>. Dodge, shoot, and swap your way through escalating chaos while meeting your \u201ccontainment targets.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Co-Op (1\u20134 Players)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or squad, coordinate limb loadouts and synergize abilities with your coworkers. Shared upgrades and evolving builds reward teamwork \u2014 and make for spectacular failures when things go wrong.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission throws new enemies, random events, and unexpected part combinations at you. No two runs, or bodies, are ever the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Alien Worlds</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From meat moons to fungal cities and rogue AI factories, explore a galaxy of strange ecosystems, hostile factions, and questionable workplace safety practices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Upgrades Between Runs</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your \u201cresearch\u201d back to HQ and cash it in for weapon unlocks, new perks, and company-approved \u201cself-improvements.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/2cab48fe66092986feaf1be48358ade9.poster.avif?t=1756971820\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/2cab48fe66092986feaf1be48358ade9.webm?t=1756971820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\